cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053: ISO 20022 bank statements and reversing entries"
abstract: >-
  A Python library and CLI that reads ISO 20022 camt.053, camt.052 and
  camt.054 cash-management messages into a typed model, filters booked
  entries by return reason code, and generates reversing entries validated
  against the official ISO 20022 schemas.
authors:
